{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは🎍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年恒例の、\n欅坂46で初詣に行きました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も、おみくじを引いたよ🥠"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPPF3FWGVKXHZJK29EMCC8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">天然石付きのおみくじ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果は…"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPPG3WXQAXPE8GZEQ9Q36S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">末吉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むむ(( _ _ ))..\n良いのか悪いのか?\nでも末吉は、小吉より良いらしい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年も末吉だった記憶🤔\n末吉に縁があるのかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お参りでは、\n今年も幸せな年になりますようにとお願いしてきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに幸あれ☘"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPPH7NHVBB7588PVX0180G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">結ばず、持ち帰りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(末吉かあ…)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPPJ75RV1QRH2FHPNJWE9W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n風邪が流行っているので気をつけて下さいね!\nみかんや苺を食べてビタミンを🍊🍓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね。\n長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}